{"id":"18e11f4651f28406","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-injury-elements.md","title":"限制函数的损伤元素与损伤阶段","display":"df-injury-elements — 限制函数的损伤元素与损伤阶段","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-injury-elements","aliases":["20-df-injury-elements"],"display":"df-injury-elements — 限制函数的损伤元素与损伤阶段","chapter":"7","section":"7.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 7.1.1；半开 use 的转换","source_printed_pages":[148],"source_pdf_pages":[182],"depends_on":["[[20-df-use]]","[[20-df-priority]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-injury-elements"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-injury-elements</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-injury-elements — 限制函数的损伤元素与损伤阶段"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 7.1.1；半开 use 的转换"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>148</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>182</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"116befd67ce6228f\" href=\"?note=116befd67ce6228f\" title=\"20-df-priority\">20-df-priority</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 为统一可计算的递增有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_s A_s\">\\(A=\\bigcup_s A_s\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 是限制函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"116befd67ce6228f\" href=\"?note=116befd67ce6228f\" title=\"20-df-priority\">20-df-priority</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injury\\text{-}elements}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r,e):=\\{x:\\exists s\\ [x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\land x&lt;r(e,s)]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{InjStage}(A_\\bullet,r,e):=\\{s:\\exists x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\ [x&lt;r(e,s)]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injury\\text{-}elements}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r,e):=\\{x:\\exists s\\ [x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\land x&lt;r(e,s)]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{InjStage}(A_\\bullet,r,e):=\\{s:\\exists x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\ [x&lt;r(e,s)]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_e\">\\(I_e\\)</span> 是损伤元素的集合，本笔记上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i(C)\">\\(I_i(C)\\)</span> 是构造记录中的损伤阶段；这里分开命名两类对象。使用上游 exclusive use，保护区间是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,r)\">\\([0,r)\\)</span>，故取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;r\">\\(x&lt;r\\)</span>；原书用最大查询位置时写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le r\">\\(x\\le r\\)</span>。每个元素至多新枚举一次，所以两集合的有限性等价；若每阶段至多枚举一个新元素，它们的基数也相同。初始化某策略并不一定实际改变其 use 以内的位，初始化记录可以比真实损伤集合更大。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 7.1.1；半开 use 的转换；印刷页 148；PDF 第 182 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-priority","status":"resolved","id":"116befd67ce6228f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-priority]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-priority","status":"resolved","id":"116befd67ce6228f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A_s","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\bigcup_s A_s","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injury\\text{-}elements}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r,e):=\\{x:\\exists s\\ [x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\land x<r(e,s)]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{InjStage}(A_\\bullet,r,e):=\\{s:\\exists x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\ [x<r(e,s)]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"I_e","display":false},{"tex":"I_i(C)","display":false},{"tex":"[0,r)","display":false},{"tex":"x<r","display":false},{"tex":"x\\le r","display":false}],"bytes":1825,"backlinks":[{"id":"daa141317125dee0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"9a23aa09d0333bb6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。"},{"id":"5152fdccfe1e0c8e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。"},{"id":"617ac90f851b7f95","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-ce-preservation]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]。"},{"id":"b0bd67260e33f88d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-lem-stage-jump-limit]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"}],"outgoing":["4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","116befd67ce6228f","60af447f5d59a8dc","e343870c773cb68e"]}